ntColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"  aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"\/><polyline points=\"22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01\"\/><\/svg><\/span><span class=\"kt-svg-icon-list-text\">Code compliance evaluation<\/span><\/li>\n\n\n<style>.kt-svg-icon-list-item-3847_b75600-5f .kt-svg-icon-list-text mark.kt-highlight{background-color:unset;font-style:normal;color:#f76a0c;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;box-decoration-break:clone;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;}<\/style>\n<li class=\"wp-block-kadence-listitem kt-svg-icon-list-item-wrap kt-svg-icon-list-item-3847_b75600-5f\"><span class=\"kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-svg-icon-fe_checkCircle kt-svg-icon-list-single\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"  fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"  aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"\/><polyline points=\"22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01\"\/><\/svg><\/span><span class=\"kt-svg-icon-list-text\">Identification of structural risks and deficiencies<\/span><\/li>\n\n\n<style>.kt-svg-icon-list-item-3847_3ab6bd-2a .kt-svg-icon-list-text mark.kt-highlight{background-color:unset;font-style:normal;color:#f76a0c;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;box-decoration-break:clone;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;}<\/style>\n<li class=\"wp-block-kadence-listitem kt-svg-icon-list-item-wrap kt-svg-icon-list-item-3847_3ab6bd-2a\"><span class=\"kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-svg-icon-fe_checkCircle kt-svg-icon-list-single\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"  fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"  aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"\/><polyline points=\"22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01\"\/><\/svg><\/span><span class=\"kt-svg-icon-list-text\">Development of strengthening and maintenance recommendations<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Our Approach<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">CDE carried out a multi-stage evaluation combining field inspection and analytical review.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">On-site inspection was conducted to assess the condition of steel structural elements, focusing on identifying signs of distress, corrosion, and degradation.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In parallel, the structural design was evaluated through a detailed review of the STAAD model to verify load-carrying capacity and compliance with applicable codes.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The assessment aimed to correlate physical observations with analytical findings to ensure a comprehensive understanding of structural performance.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Findings<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The evaluation identified localized areas of distress in steel elements, including signs of minor corrosion. While not critical at present, these issues could lead to long-term deterioration if left unaddressed.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Structural analysis highlighted specific elements and connections requiring reinforcement to improve load distribution and ensure adequate safety margins.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The review also emphasized the importance of proactive maintenance to prevent further degradation and maintain structural performance.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Solutions &amp; Recommendations<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">CDE recommended targeted strengthening and maintenance measures to enhance structural integrity and durability.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Strengthening of identified weak elements and connections was proposed to improve load-carrying capacity.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Corrosion protection measures were recommended to mitigate environmental effects and extend service life.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A periodic monitoring and maintenance strategy was advised to ensure long-term performance and prevent future deterioration.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Additionally, updating as-built documentation was recommended to ensure compliance with current standards and facilitate future assessments.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Outcome<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The assessment provided the client with a clear and reliable understanding of the structural condition of the warehouse.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The findings and recommendations enabled the client to make an informed investment decision, supported by a clear roadmap for strengthening, maintenance, and long-term asset management.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Services Delivered<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n<style>.wp-block-kadence-iconlist.kt-svg-icon-list-items3847_01559a-67:not(.this-stops-third-party-issues){margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;}.wp-block-kadence-iconlist.kt-svg-icon-list-items3847_01559a-67 ul.kt-svg-icon-list:not(.this-prevents-issues):not(.this-stops-third-party-issues):not(.tijsloc){margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:var(--global-kb-spacing-sm, 1.5rem);margin-left:0px;}.wp-block-kadence-iconlist.kt-svg-icon-list-items3847_01559a-67 ul.kt-svg-icon-list{grid-row-gap:5px;}.wp-block-kadence-iconlist.kt-svg-icon-list-items3847_01559a-67 ul.kt-svg-icon-list .kt-svg-icon-list-item-wrap .kt-svg-icon-list-single{margin-right:10px;}.kt-svg-icon-list-items3847_01559a-67 ul.kt-svg-icon-list .kt-svg-icon-list-level-0 .kt-svg-icon-list-single svg{font-size:20px;}<\/style>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-iconlist kt-svg-icon-list-items kt-svg-icon-list-items3